<title>USA: Easco hires manufacturing VP.</title>
<headline>Easco hires manufacturing VP.</headline>
<dateline>GIRARD, Ohio 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easco Inc said Wednesday it appointed James R. McKeithan as vice president-manufacturing.</p>
<p>The position was vacant.</p>
<p>McKeithan was previously vice president-production of CasTech Aluminum Group Inc.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
